  "bodyHtml": "\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/560aa62bed915d035c00001b/the-highway-code-signals-by-authorised-persons.pdf\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download ‘Signals by authorised persons’ (PDF, 468KB)</a></p>\n</div>\n\nPolice officers\n\nStop\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/559e6c97ed915d159500002e/police-officers-traffic-from-front.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Traffic approaching from the front (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/559e6cafe5274a155c00003b/police-officers-traffic-from-front-and-behind.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Traffic approaching from both front and behind (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/559e6cc5e5274a155c00003d/police-officers-traffic-from-behind.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Traffic approaching from behind (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\nTo beckon traffic on\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b5eac240f0b67aa3000002/police-officer-beckon-from-the-side.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ From the side (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b5eada40f0b6790f000003/police-officer-beckon-from-the-front.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ From the front (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b5eaf140f0b6790f000005/police-officer-beckon-from-behind.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ From behind* (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p>*In Wales, bilingual signs appear on emergency services vehicles and clothing</p>\n\nArm signals to persons controlling traffic\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55cb0962e5274a547300001f/car-arm-signal-straight-on.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ I want to go straight on (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55cb094940f0b61374000019/car-arm-signal-turn-left.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ I want to turn left; use either hand (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b5eb57ed915d07e2000001/car-arm-signals-turn-right.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ I want to turn right (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\nDriver and Vehicle Standards Agency officers and traffic officers\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/591dd678ed915d20f800005b/traffic-officer-car.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Traffic officer (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/591dd688ed915d20fb00005a/dvsa-officer-car.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ DVSA officer (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p>These officers now have new powers to stop/direct vehicles and will be using hand signals and light\nsignals similar to those used by police. You <strong>MUST</strong> obey any signals given (see <a href=\"/code/rule/107\">Rules 107</a> and <a href=\"/code/rule/108\">108</a>).</p>\n\nSchool crossing patrols\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b5ebf3e5274a21ec000001/school-crossing-patrol-not-ready.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Not ready to cross pedestrians (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b5ec22e5274a21ec000003/school-crossing-patrol-barrier-to-stop.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Barrier to stop pedestrians crossing (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b5ec4fed915d07e2000003/school-crossing-patrol-vehicle-prepare-stop.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ Ready to cross pedestrians, vehicles must be prepared to stop (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b5ec6fe5274a2152000002/school-crossing-patrol-all-vehicles-stop.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">↗ All vehicles must stop (diagram, online)</a></p>\n\n\n",
